  "description": "The proposal seeks planning permission to change the use of the existing 3-bedroom semi detached house at 18 Hartley Road, CR0 2PG, from a ClassC3 dwellinghouse to short-term holiday accommodation. the property will b used to host temporary stays for individuals, families, or small groups, with bookings typically lasting from 2 nights up to a maximum of 90 nights per guest. \n\nThe property will be managed directly by the owner through a letting platform (AIRBNB) with strict house rules in place to ensure the peaceful enjoyment of -neighbouring properties. These include limits on occupancy, a no- party policy, check-in/check-out procedures, and regular cleaning between guests.\n\nThere are no proposed external alterations to the building. The internal layout will remain unchanged. Waste disposal will be managed in line with Croydon Councils residential waste collection services, and parking arrangements will be managed within existing street layout. \n\nThis change of use does not involve any structural development, extensions, or physical building works. the proposal is solely for material change of use to reflect its use as short-term holiday accommodation, offering flexible stays that support tourism and business travel in the area. ",
